WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.040
- How about the first
time we actually met?

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:02.900
I hope you remember.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.733
- I do.

00:00:03.733 --> 00:00:06.130
I literally say like, do you
know, do you remember meeting?

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:06.963
I was like, absolutely.

00:00:06.963 --> 00:00:07.796
It was in a hallway.

00:00:07.796 --> 00:00:08.690
It was so random.

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:09.560
It was with clay Aiken

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:11.410
and we just sat down in a hallway.

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:12.330
Were you locked out?

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:13.584
Someone was locked up
or something happened.

00:00:13.584 --> 00:00:16.350
There was a reason why
we were in the hallway.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:17.183
- Yeah. Yes.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:19.010
I had forgotten that morning.

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:20.300
We were doing Celebrity Apprentice.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:21.830
It was down to me and Clay Aiken.

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:23.860
and I'd forgotten, that morning,

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:25.690
to put the little card on the door

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:27.290
So the housekeeper would know to come in.

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:29.890
So I get home and my room is a wreck

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:31.670
the way I left it at 7:00 AM.

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:33.670
So I told Clay,

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:36.510
I'm just going to sit here
while she does my room.

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:38.310
And God works in mysterious ways.

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:39.590
The elevator door opens.

00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:43.500
Clay Aiken and I are sitting
on the floor of Trump Tower.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.310
And you walk out of the elevator

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:47.750
and you were clean as the Board of Health.

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:51.490
I don't know who dressed you
that day, but it was nuts.

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:54.434
And I say that only to
say you did something

00:00:54.434 --> 00:00:56.136
that made me love you forever.

00:00:56.136 --> 00:00:56.969
- What?

00:00:56.969 --> 00:01:01.090
- You put your purse down and
you sat on the floor with us.

00:01:01.090 --> 00:01:02.250
- Yeah!

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.360
- We talked for like an hour and a half,

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:06.030
and that was the best way

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:08.130
to meet one of my favorite singers,

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:11.270
who actually reminds me a lot of Aretha.

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:14.870
- You better stop it right
now, sir, I will cry.

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:16.353
I'm emotional this week.

